            <div class="pi-sections">
              <div class="pi-section fade-in">
                <div class="pi-section-label">Biography</div>
                <div class="pi-section-bio">
                  <p class="pi-intro-bio">Namhoon Cho is Assistant Professor in the Department of Aerospace Engineering at Seoul National University, South Korea since September 2025. He received his BSc and PhD degrees in Mechanical and Aerospace Engineering from Seoul National University, South Korea, in August 2012 and February 2017, respectively. Previously, he was Lecturer in Control and Optimisation in the Centre for Assured and Connected Autonomy at Cranfield University, United Kingdom from November 2024 to August 2025. He was a research fellow at Cranfield University from January 2021 to November 2024 with the award of a Cranfield 75th Anniversary Fellowship to pursue research on AI for Exploitation of Data-Driven Approach in Control for Aerospace Systems. He was a senior researcher in the 1st R&amp;D Institute, Agency for Defense Development, South Korea, from March 2019 to December 2020, where he was involved in research and development of guidance and control systems for missiles and developed design tools based on optimisation techniques. He was a research fellow in the Department of Mechanical and Aerospace Engineering, Seoul National University, South Korea, from March 2017 to February 2019. He develops constructive methodologies to design control algorithms for aerospace and robotic systems.</p>
                  <div class="pi-intro-interests">
                    <p class="pi-intro-interests-label">Research Interests</p>
                    <p class="pi-intro-interests-text">Control-theoretic design of optimisation algorithms, robust adaptive control with online model learning, data-driven safe control frameworks, learning-enabled control with safety assurance, and automated control engineering.</p>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="pi-section fade-in">
                <div class="pi-section-label">Experience</div>
                <ul class="pi-section-list">
                  <li>(2025.9.1~Present) Assistant Professor, Department of Aerospace Engineering, Seoul National University</li>
                  <li>(2025.9.1~Present) Visiting Academic, Centre for Assured and Connected Autonomy, Cranfield University</li>
                  <li>(2024.11.29~2025.8.12) Lecturer in Control and Optimisation, Centre for Assured and Connected Autonomy, Cranfield University</li>
                  <li>(2024.10.25~Present) Academic Advisor, Mechanical AI, Inc.</li>
                  <li>(2021.1.18~2024.11.28) Research Fellow, Cranfield University</li>
                  <li>(2019.3.1~2020.12.31) Senior Researcher, Agency for Defense Development</li>
                  <li>(2017.12.1~2019.2.28) Postdoctoral Research Fellow, Seoul National University</li>
                  <li>(2017.3.1~2018.8.31) Researcher, Automation and Systems Research Institute, Seoul National University</li>
                  <li>(2015.11.14~2016.4.28) Visiting Research Student, Cranfield University</li>
                  <li>(2008.8.19~2008.8.28) The 2nd International Olympiad on Astronomy and Astrophysics (IOAA)</li>
                  <li>(2007.11.21~2007.11.29) The 3rd Asian-Pacific Astronomy Olympiad (APAO)</li>
                </ul>
              </div>
              <div class="pi-section fade-in">
