                <ul class="pi-section-list">
                  <li>Excellent Reviewer for JGCD (2025)</li>
                  <li>Fellow of Advance HE (FHEA) (2025.5)</li>
                  <li>Associate Fellow of Advance HE (AFHEA) (2024.11)</li>
                  <li>Cranfield 75th Anniversary Fellowship (2021.1)</li>
                  <li>Outstanding Doctoral Dissertation Award, Seoul National University (2017.2)</li>
                  <li>Summa Cum Laude Graduate, Seoul National University (2012.8)</li>
                  <li>STEM Honor Society Membership</li>
                  <li>Academic Excellence Scholarship</li>
                </ul>
              </div>
              <div class="pi-section fade-in">
                <div class="pi-section-label">Media</div>
                <ul class="pi-section-list">
                  <li>(2021.6) Early Career Researcher Interview, "Unified Design Frameworks for Control and Estimation with Aerospace Applications," Mechanical Engineering and Robotics Research Information Center, Written Interview <em>(in Korean)</em></li>
                </ul>
              </div>
            </div>
